                        <h2 class="title">青春无悔，高考必胜——绍兴一中2024届高考助威活动</h2>
                        <!-- 副标题 -->
                        <h3 class="subTitle"><span></span></h3>
                        <script>
                        $(".Subheading span:empty").parent().hide()
                        </script>
                        <div class="property"> <span>文章来源：</span> <span>作者：</span> <span>发布时间：2024年05月31日</span> <span>点击数：
    <script language="JavaScript" type="text/JavaScript" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/Common/GetHits.aspx?id=19924"></script>
    次</span>  <span><span id="content_AdminEdit"></span>
<script type="text/javascript">
$(document).ready(function()
{
    $.pe.ajax('admineditcheck',{params:{itemId:19924},success:function(s) {
        if ($(s).find('status').text() == 'OK') {
            var managedir = "/Common/GetContentEdit.aspx?itemId=19924";
           $("#content_AdminEdit").html("【<a href='" + managedir + "' target='_blank'>进入后台编辑</a>】")
        }
    }});
});
</script></span> </div>
                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:center;line-height:29px">
</p><p style="text-indent: 32px;line-height: 29px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">青春如同六月的热浪，澎湃着无限激情，前进是这个季节的主旋律，引领着我们勇往直前。在高考这条挑战与机遇并存的征途上，每一份祝福与加油的呐喊，化作不绝于耳的回响，深深镌刻在每一位高三学子的心田，激励着逐梦的脚步永不停歇。</span><span style="font-family:宋体">5月25日，绍兴一中举行了“劈波斩浪齐助威 同心同行创辉煌”2024届高考助威活动，为2024届高三学子送上高考祝福。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:center;line-height:29px"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px">青春开唱</span></strong></p><p style="text-indent: 32px;line-height: 29px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">夏日午后，图书馆前，学弟学妹满怀热情，为高三的学长学姐送上真挚祝福。随着伴奏响起，由校合唱社同学领唱，全体同学大合唱《我是如此相信》《七里香》《逆光》等歌曲。</span><span style="font-family:宋体">“我是如此相信，在背后支撑的是你，一直与我并肩而行，仰望等太阳升起”、“我逆着光，却看见那是泪光，那力量”……全场的歌声诉说着面对高考的希望和力量，是你，是我，此刻的同频。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent: 32px;line-height: 29px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体"></span></span></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/5/202405311115076216.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202405311115076216.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/5/202405311115071638.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202405311115071638.JPG" /></p><p style="text-indent: 32px;line-height: 29px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">
</span></span>
</p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:center;line-height:29px"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px">擂鼓</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px">助威</span></strong></p><p style="text-indent: 32px;line-height: 29px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">鼓声阵阵催奋进，加油声声扬激情。</span><span style="font-family:宋体">“高考加油！”王琛校长喊着激昂澎湃的口号为高三学子擂鼓助威，让现场的气氛到达高潮。教师代表和学生代表随后送上了击鼓、武术、舞剑表演，彰显勇敢和刚毅。我们一同期待高三学子们能够用青春、智慧、汗水书写高考新辉煌，圆梦六月。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent: 32px;line-height: 29px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体"></span></span></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/5/202405311115294934.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202405311115294934.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/5/202405311115301004.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202405311115301004.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/5/202405311115307853.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202405311115307853.JPG" /></p><p style="text-indent: 32px;line-height: 29px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">
</span></span>
</p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:center;line-height:29px"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px">呐喊祝福</span></strong></p><p style="text-indent: 32px;line-height: 29px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px">高一高二的学弟学妹们用他们热烈的呼喊，昂扬的热情，为高三学长学姐们送上自己真诚的祝福。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 32px;line-height: 29px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"></span></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/5/202405311115473770.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202405311115473770.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/5/202405311115509194.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202405311115509194.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/5/202405311115503216.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202405311115503216.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/5/202405311115499023.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202405311115499023.JPG" /></p><p style="text-indent: 32px;line-height: 29px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px">
</span>
</p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:center;line-height:29px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">春风吹</span><span style="font-family:宋体">战鼓擂</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:center;line-height:29px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px">今年高考谁怕谁</span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:center;line-height:29px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">少年狂</span><span style="font-family:宋体">当自强</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:center;line-height:29px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px">挥斥方遒斗志昂</span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:center;line-height:29px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px">决战高考铸辉煌</span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:center;line-height:29px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px">  </span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px">信一中，定成功！</span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:center;line-height:29px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"> </span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px">高三加油！一中加油！高考必胜！</span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:29px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px">呐喊声一浪高过一浪，响彻校园，高三学子热切的回应一波赛过一波，振奋人心，感动与热血在校园蔓延。高考助威活动在大合唱《我的未来不是梦》中划上了圆满句号。</span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:29px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px">今日，一起唱的歌很美，一起喊出的誓言也很酷，这就是青春！青春</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px">无悔</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px">，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px">筑梦前行。一</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px">中学子们，去追寻心中的光吧，自由</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px">而</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">热烈！带上勇气，带上祝福，奋力前行，相信自己，此战必胜</span>!</span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:29px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px">祝愿一中全体高三学子，在高考的战场上，所向披靡，金榜题名，再铸辉煌！</span></p><p>
</p>
    
    </div><!--endprint-->
